body pot
plane XY
ngon 0.48 8
pot: extrude 0.4 scale=1.25
color #d26e46
body leaves
leaf_a: blob 0,0,0.55+0.3*h r=0.3,0.3,0.32*h mode=shell segments=20
leaf_b: blob 0.12,-0.08,0.65+0.3*h r=0.3,0.3,0.32*h mode=shell segments=20
leaf_c: blob -0.1,-0.1,0.75+0.3*h r=0.3,0.3,0.32*h mode=shell segments=20
color #46aa50 part=leaf_a gloss=0.6
color #46b950 part=leaf_b gloss=0.6
color #46c850 part=leaf_c gloss=0.6
